OL,5,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FIn 1944, American forces launched
OL,7,     Fa final push to retake the
OL,8,     FPhilippines after two years of
OL,9,     FJapanese occupation.
OL,10,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,11,     FThe turning point of the Pacific
OL,12,     FWar, focusing on the American B-29
OL,13,     Fbombing campaign against Japan
OL,14,     Fnear the end of World War II.
OL,15,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,16,     FBea tells the women not to rely on
OL,17,     FNoeline for any favours, and Meg
OL,18,     Finvites Gail to her flat-warming
OL,19,     Fparty, only for Gail's husband to
OL,20,     Fmake a scene about Gail's
OL,21,     Fparenting.
